[00:12.80] There are places I'll remember
[00:19.77] All my life, though some have changed
[00:26.43] Some forever not for better
[00:33.20] Some have gone and some remain
[00:40.37] All these places have their moments
[00:47.55] With lovers and friends I still can recall
[00:53.72] Some are dead and some are living
[01:01.40] In my life I've loved them all
[01:11.15] But of all these friends and lovers
[01:18.01] There is no one compares with you
[01:24.87] And these memories lose their meaning
[01:31.71] When I think of love as something new
[01:38.66] Though I know I'll never lose affection
[01:45.88] For people and things that went before
[01:52.79] I know I'll often stop and think about them
[01:59.67] In my life I love you more
